- Hey LegalEagles, today
we're talking about

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.870
the college admissions scandal.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:30.350
We're gonna mix things up a little bit

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.540
because this story has everything.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:33.950
The rich and famous

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:36.420
lots of bad things happening to bad people

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.950
and RICO violations.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:38.940
So today we're gonna talk about

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:40.660
the allegations in the indictment

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.800
and we're also gonna
talk about what it means

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:44.990
to have a RICO prosecution.

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:46.280
So here's the background.

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:48.410
50 people including Full House actress

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.700
Lori Loughlin AKA Aunt Becky

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.080
and actress Felicity Huffman

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:55.191
are facing federal RICO charges
for allegedly participating

00:01:55.191 --> 00:01:57.440
in an elaborate bribery scheme

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:59.900
to get their children
into elite universities.

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:02.250
There are a lot of rich
and famous people here

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:05.360
but most people know about
Lori Laughlin from Full House

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.630
so I'm going to refer to
defendants collectively

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:09.022
as Aunt Becky.

00:02:09.022 --> 00:02:10.863
♪ Bad boys, bad boys ♪
(audience laughing)

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:12.370
