00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:15.450
- In this case, the kingpin,
if you will, William Singer

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:16.900
created a company called

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.020
The Edge College and Career Network LLC

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:22.300
also known as The Key,
ostensibly as a for-profit

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:24.970
college counseling and
preparation business.

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:28.860
He also started the Key
Worldwide Foundation or KWF

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:32.530
as a 501(c)3 non-profit
for similar purposes.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.540
The government's indictment
alleges that Singer

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:37.370
engaged in rampant racketeering or fraud

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.280
that falls into three buckets.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.700
First the indictment alleges that Singer

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.350
facilitated cheating on
the ACT and SAT exams

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:47.160
in exchange for bribes.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.080
Number two, it alleges that
he designated applicants

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.890
as purported recruits for
competitive college athletic teams

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:55.600
without regard to whether the student

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.550
had actually participated
in athletics at all.

00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:01.380
And number three, concealing
the nature and source

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:04.430
of these bribery payments
by funneling the payments

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:07.510
through the KWF charitable
foundation account.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:09.110
So let's talk about
the first type of fraud

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.240
and racketeering that's
alleged in the indictment.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:12.610
The government's indictment alleges

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.220
that to facilitate the cheating

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.250
Singer counseled Aunt
Becky to seek extended time

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.640
on her kids' exams by
having doctors falsely state

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:22.830
that her children had
learning disabilities

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:25.010
in order to obtain the
medical documentation

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.100
required for the college board

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.070
to grant extra time on
the standardized tests.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:32.007
- You're in big trouble, mister!

00:03:32.007 --> 00:03:33.930
- Additionally the indictment states

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.530
that in exchange for bribery payments

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.100
co-conspirators allowed Aunt Becky's kids

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:43.500
to secretly take the ACT and
SAT tests in special rooms

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.040
where they were given more time

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:47.600
or the children's responses
were actually replaced

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:49.110
with the correct answers.

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:51.190
- If your children are accepted here

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.880
you'll be expected to
work with them at home

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.170
rather intensively so that they may reap

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.940
the optimum benefits from our curriculum.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:00.400
- Oh, yeah, well our kids
love to reap. (chuckles)

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.760
- In he second type of
fraud Aunt Becky paid Singer

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.320
approximately $25 million dollars

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.940
over the course of 2011 through 2019

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:10.140
to bribe coaches and
university administrators

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.490
to designate her children
as recruited athletes

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:15.780
or other favored admissions categories

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.970
to jump the line into college.

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:22.970
- We may have, well he may
have embellished, lied a bit

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:25.540
on our application.
(audience laughing)

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:28.880
- Honest, she's been on
this honesty kick all week.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:29.713
- Oh my God, you guys.

00:04:29.713 --> 00:04:31.450
The Skillshare plug at
the end of this video

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.010
is going to be so epic.

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:36.020
Aunt Becky often photoshopped
fake photos of her kids

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:40.210
onto other athletes to make
the fraud seem more believable.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.600
And given that Aunt Becky lives in L.A.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:45.310
a lot of the fraud
concerned L.A. colleges.

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:48.380
As a UCLA grad myself, it gives
