00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.940
that this scandal appears to
permeate through the entire

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:53.030
University of Southern California

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:55.940
resulting in multiple
coaches at USC being fired.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:59.480
It gives me no pleasure
at all to point that out.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:03.080
None at all, none.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.760
And I have no idea why
people often refer to USC

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.472
as the University of Spoiled Children.

00:05:08.472 --> 00:05:10.722
(laughing)

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.570
Oh my God, I'm gonna
get in trouble for that

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:16.403
but it's worth it.

00:05:16.403 --> 00:05:18.590
That takes me to the third type of fraud.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:21.690
Of course, most or all
of these bribery payments

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:24.400
were labeled as charitable contributions.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.290
So essentially these million dollar bribes

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:28.630
were subsidized by the federal government.

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:31.210
In correspondence that
Singer sent to Aunt Becky

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:33.960
in response to a purported
charitable contribution

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:38.330
to KWF of $251,000, Singer stated that

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:41.286
your generosity will allow us
to move forward with our plans

00:05:41.286 --> 00:05:44.650
to provide educational and
self-enrichment programs

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.480
to disadvantaged youth.

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:49.330
So to summarize, Aunt Becky
spent millions of dollars

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.820
on bribes and fraudulent payments

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.530
to get her kids into college

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.360
got to write all of that amount off

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:56.020
as a charitable deduction

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.210
which effectively cuts the cost in half

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:01.140
subsidized by other taxpayers
and got a letter saying

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:03.440
that she was helping disadvantaged youth.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.680
You want class riots?

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.600
Because this is how you get class riots.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:09.240
By the way, it's worthy noting
that all of this got started

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:11.070
because one of the
participants wanted to get

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.360
a lighter sentence for securities fraud.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:16.330
The SEC was investigating
a guy named Morrie Tobin

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.520
a Los Angeles financial exec

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:21.060
for a pump-and-dump investment scheme.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.430
He actually plead guilty

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.360
to conspiracy to commit securities fraud

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:25.850
and hasn't actually been charged

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.780
in this particular
college admissions scandal

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.860
but it appears that he
snitched on Aunt Becky

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:32.120
to get a reduced sentence in that case.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:35.080
But let's talk about the RICO prosecution.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.870
If you follow Ken White on Twitter

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:38.740
and you absolutely should

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:41.640
he often says that it is never RICO.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:44.990
RICO is to Popehat what
lupus is to Dr. House.

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:46.960
It's just never that.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.100
But this time it actually is RICO.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.050
RICO, or The Racketeer Influenced

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.770
and Corrupt Organizations
Act, is a weird animal.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:55.270
I've handled a few RICO claims

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.780
but always from the civil side
because I'm a civil attorney.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.460
But this is criminal RICO.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.350
Most people think about RICO prosecutions

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:05.890
as being synonymous with, the
government is really serious

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.640
and is bringing down the hammer.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.610
But that's generally wrong.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:10.790
It's also understandable

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:14.730
because of the context in
which RICO usually appears.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.500
RICO was initially passed in the 1970s

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.910
with the intent to pursue the Mafia.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.990
The idea behind RICO was to tie
all of their crimes together

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:25.160
into one case which
allowed the prosecution

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.420
to be able to connect the incidents

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.150
allowing for convictions of the
bosses behind all the crimes

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.310
with all of the underlings as well.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:34.570
It was necessary because it's really hard

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:35.750
to prosecute the mob.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.360
Traditional tools like conspiracy
charges were hard to prove

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:41.770
without direct links to
the upper mob bosses.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:45.170
So some would say that RICO is
written intentionally vaguely

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.890
to capture enterprises like the mob

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.860
that would otherwise evade prosecution.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.770
To this day, when prosecutors have

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:54.680
traditional criminal law
tools available to use

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.240
they often use those to avoid

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.550
the convoluted issues of RICO.

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:01.240
But in general, a properly
stated RICO claim requires

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:06.090
one, conduct, two, of an
enterprise, three, a pattern

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:09.160
and four, a pattern of
racketeering activity.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:10.890
Conduct here is pretty clear.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:13.460
Bribes, fraud, it's all over the place.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.320
The enterprise at issue here is The Key

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.300
and all the participants
of that organization.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:21.360
A pattern under RICO
only requires two acts

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.550
and here there are many more of that.

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:27.220
And the element of racketeering
activity is extremely broad.

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:29.700
The statute includes things
like kidnapping, gambling,

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:32.510
arson, robbery, bribery, extortion

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:34.200
and a list of a whole lot of other things.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:37.180
It's actually impossible to
have a racketeering claim

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.560
without a finding that
the defendant is guilty

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.450
of another criminal violation.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.740
Often this is called a RICO predicate.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:47.030
Here the RICO predicates
include mail fraud, wire fraud

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.210
and money laundering.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.200
And interestingly, here
the ring leader Singer

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.570
was a cooperating witness

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:55.900
and basically went through
this Rolodex of co-conspirators

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.750
calling up his old
acquaintances and saying

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:00.000
hey, remember the fraud we did last year?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.445
You were a willing participant, right?

00:09:02.445 --> 00:09:05.528
(trombone squawking)

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.110
Cool, cool.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.573
If the government proves up its case

00:09:10.573 --> 00:09:12.980
which it looks like it
should be able to do

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.810
it should be a pretty
straightforward RICO prosecution.

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.110
And a quick note about
the class action lawsuits

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:20.560
that have been filed by other
students that didn't get in

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.790
in the wake of this RICO prosecution.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.910
They're going to fail and
they're going to fail hard.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.420
The point of a class
action is to adjudicate

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:30.930
a bunch of very similar
cases at the same time.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:32.900
And that just isn't the case here.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.840
First it would be nearly
impossible to prove

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.660
that you were harmed, in other words,

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.370
that you didn't get into college

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.590
because of this other
fraud that was going on.

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.410
It would also be nearly
impossible to prove

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:45.600
that you were particularly
injured in a similar way

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.290
to all of the other class members

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:50.670
since admissions decisions
are on an individual basis.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.200
And on top of that, what
would your damages be?

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.330
So these class action cases

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.220
lack the commonality and typicality

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:00.340
that is necessary for a
class action case to proceed.

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:01.960
Unfortunately this RICO prosecution

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:04.200
couldn't have happened to a nicer person.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.140
- I'm like excited to go prank my,

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:07.750
like, do the school prank

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.320
but I'm also literally never at school

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.270
that I think my class doesn't even.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.329
Maybe they forget I go there.

00:10:14.329 --> 00:10:15.310
(laughs) I'm just kidding.

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:18.380
- Olivia Jade clearly
got into USC on merit.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.510
Now what I don't understand
is why you would spend

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.960
millions of dollars bribing
your way into college

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:26.040
especially USC, when you could, you know,

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.490
just be a better student.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.213
For example, you could
take Francesco D'Alessio's

00:10:29.213 --> 00:10:32.350
